{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>When I send you and your little ones.</b> All the more so the livestock." "<b>See that it is evil before you.</b> See that in this undertaking of yours you are walking toward evil for yourselves and will find it — as in יֵלֵךְ לָמוּת (Genesis 25:32), רַגְלֶיהָ יוֹרְדוֹת מָוֶת (Proverbs 5:5), and as the Sages of blessed memory said: וְהֵם רָצִים לִבְאֵר שַׁחַת (Berakhot 28a)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:01.427741877Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}